  "bio": "Alex Rodrigues is a talented tattoo artist from Goiânia, Brazil, who has developed a unique set of skills that allow him to bring intricate floral, fineline and minimalist designs to life. With a specialty in black and gray, micro-realism, and watercolor designs, he demonstrates a high level of professionalism and attention to detail in every piece of art at his studio, Arthandstattoo.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Goiânia, Goias, Brazil\n\nTatuagens autorais, realismo e cobertura \nTransformo histórias em arte única para quem valoriza exclusividade\nAgende seu orçamento VIP no link abaixo!",
